<title>NEW ZEALAND: Wilson Neill yr loss widens to NZ$2.47m.</title>
<headline>Wilson Neill yr loss widens to NZ$2.47m.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss			    2.47 vs 2.30 loss</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		    loss 0.73 vs 0.7 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover			     0.689 vs 7.83</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)     337 vs same</p>
<p>Note - Wilson Neill Ltd is a property company.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
